# Warnings `allium check` reports that are expected: checker gaps, where the
# spec is right and the checker misreads it. scripts/check-allium.sh fails on
# any warning not listed here, and on every error.
#
# Format: one warning per line, three tab-separated fields:
#   <spec file>	<diagnostic code>	<message, exactly as the checker prints it>
# No line numbers, so an edit elsewhere in a spec does not break an entry.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Add an entry only with a comment beside the declaration in the spec saying
# why the warning is expected. When the checker stops reporting one, the gate
# prints a note; remove the line then.
#
# Gaps behind the entries (filed on juxt/allium-tools):
#   definition.unused: a value or enum used only as a contract return type
#     (#106) or only through literals of a trigger parameter is not credited.
#   externalEntity.missingSourceHint: an external entity governed by a tool
#     (git, tmux) or the store, with no spec to import, cannot silence it.
#   entity.unused: storage's DataDirectory is the anchor other specs cite in
#     prose; no rule names it.

docs/specs/agent-tree.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'PaneView' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/agent-tree.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'PaneResumeAnswer' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/dispatch-prompt.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'Bump' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/dispatch-prompt.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'Preceding' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/feeds.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'FeedCommandRun' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'StartupConfigOutcome' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'SessionLaunchFailure' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'RetireOutcome' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'ManagedAddressState' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'ModulePublishOutcome' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'StartupAbortReason' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.
docs/specs/startup.allium	allium.definition.unused	Value 'BoardExitCause' is declared but not referenced elsewhere.

docs/specs/core.allium	allium.externalEntity.missingSourceHint	External entity 'Worktree' has no obvious governing specification import in this module.
docs/specs/core.allium	allium.externalEntity.missingSourceHint	External entity 'TmuxWindow' has no obvious governing specification import in this module.
docs/specs/core.allium	allium.externalEntity.missingSourceHint	External entity 'TmuxPane' has no obvious governing specification import in this module.
docs/specs/core.allium	allium.externalEntity.missingSourceHint	External entity 'UserIdentity' has no obvious governing specification import in this module.

docs/specs/storage.allium	allium.entity.unused	Entity 'DataDirectory' is declared but not referenced elsewhere in this specification.
